@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Several field errors + struct-level rule (__all__) -> 422
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "capacity": 0, "opensAt": "18:00", "closesAt": "08:00"}

### Passes DTO rules, rejected by the RoomName domain type (blank after trim) -> 422
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "   ", "capacity": 5}

### Valid – name normalized (trimmed) by RoomName::parse
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "  Yellow room ", "capacity": 5}

### Malformed JSON -> 400 as JSON body
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":

